            "verseId": "NUM.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ũthatu wa Mbalaki wamwakanĩa Mbalaamu, na akũnangan’ya mbĩ; na Mbalaki amwĩa Mbalaamu, Nĩnĩnakwĩtie ũumanĩe amaitha makwa, na, sisya, nũmaathimĩte ki mavinda aa atatũ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwondũ wa ũu yu kĩa ũende kwaku: nĩnasũanĩaa ũkũnenevya na ndaĩa nene; ĩndĩ, sisya, Yeova nĩwakũsiĩĩe ndũkethĩwe na ndaĩa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Mbalaamu amwĩa Mbalaki, Ndyaaneena na atũmwa maku ala wamatũmie kwakwa, ngĩmea, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ethĩwa Mbalaki akanenga nyũmba yake yusũĩte vetha na thaavu, nditonya kũvĩta ndeto ya Yeova, kwĩka ũseo kana ũthũku na kĩsũanĩo kyakwa mwene; ũla Yeova ũneenaa, nĩw’o nĩneena? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na yu, sisya, nĩngũthi kwa andũ makwa: ũka, na ngakũmanyĩthya ũla andũ aa makameka andũ maku mĩthenya ya mũminũkĩlyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
